 "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/28/"}}, {"flavor_text": "The yellow patterns it bears are old scars. The\nenergy from Mega Evolution runs through them,\ncausing it sharp pain and suffering.", "language": {"name": "en", "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"}, "version": {"name": "ultra-sun", "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/29/"}}, {"flavor_text": "The moment it charges into its opponent, sharp\nspikes pop out of Sharpedo\u2019s head, leaving its\nopponent with deep wounds.", "language": {"name": "en", "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"}, "version": {"name": "ultra-moon", "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/30/"}}]}